# Successor to the [[Soviet Union]], this is a [[confederation]] of eleven [[former]] [[Soviet]] [[republic]]s: [[Armenia]], [[Azerbaijan]], [[Belarus]], [[Kazakhstan]], [[Kyrgyzstan]], [[Moldova]], [[Russia]], [[Tajikistan]], [[Turkmenistan]], [[Ukraine]], and [[Uzbekistan]].

